  characterName: Ardley
  description: "Adley is a 28 year old single freelancer with a middle school education
    and a low income of \u20AC17,500. While a recluse in the physical world, he finds
    genuine happiness and community entirely online. He does not abuse substances;
    instead, his pathology is exclusively digital, treating the internet as his true
    home to compensate for his lack of real-world support."
